  <comment>Generate versioned Integration Event envelopes and handlers for User, Service, OAuth Client, Identity Provider, Tenant Resource, Role, Role Membership, and Grant registration and lifecycle events. Validate globally unique event identifiers, event type, schema version, UTC occurrence time, correlation identifier, source, and resource payload. Process event identifiers atomically at most once so replay records success without duplicate records, memberships, Grants, or lifecycle transitions. Reject unsupported versions, missing fields, unknown references, stale concurrency tokens, and Tenant mismatches with the event identifier and exact non-secret reason while leaving authority state unchanged.</comment>
